    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Preparing for an interview",
     "texto": [
      "**Arbeidsintervju** is a job interview. To answer, describe a specific situation, what you did and the result. That way you can back up your qualities with examples."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about strengths",
     "texto": [
      "**Styrke** is a strength; **utfordring**, a challenge. **Å være vant til å** means to be used to doing something."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
